            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/v3/api-docs",
            "description": "Contrato OpenAPI generado por Springdoc.\n\nEste request es GET y no necesita Body.",
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('HTTP 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "01 - Autenticación local + MFA",
      "description": "Secuencia recomendada: Register → Verify Email → MFA Setup → MFA Confirm → Login → MFA Verify. Después usa Refresh y Logout. Introduce manualmente `verificationCode` (correo) y `totpCode` (Google Authenticator) en el environment.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "1. Registrar usuario",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/register",
            "description": "Crea un usuario o reanuda un registro local incompleto con el mismo correo y contraseña. Devuelve nextStep=EMAIL_VERIFY o MFA_SETUP.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"displayName\": \"{{displayName}}\",\n  \"email\": \"{{email}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('HTTP 201', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
                  "const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (j.token && j.nextStep === 'MFA_SETUP') pm.environment.set('setupToken', j.token);",
                  "if (j.nextStep) pm.environment.set('authNextStep', j.nextStep);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "2. Verificar correo",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/verify-email",
            "description": "Valida el código de correo. Si es correcto, deja la cuenta en MFA_SETUP_REQUIRED y devuelve setupToken para mostrar el QR de Google Authenticator.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{email}}\",\n  \"code\": \"{{verificationCode}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('HTTP 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (j.setupToken) pm.environment.set('setupToken', j.setupToken);",
                  "if (j.nextStep) pm.environment.set('authNextStep', j.nextStep);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "3. Configurar MFA - generar secreto/QR",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/mfa/setup",
            "description": "Genera el secreto TOTP y otpAuthUri. Escanea el otpAuthUri con Google Authenticator o usa el secreto para agregar la cuenta manualmente.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"setupToken\": \"{{setupToken}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('HTTP 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (j.secret) pm.environment.set('totpSecret', j.secret);",
                  "if (j.otpAuthUri) pm.environment.set('otpAuthUri', j.otpAuthUri);",
                  "console.log('TOTP secret:', j.secret);",
                  "console.log('otpauth URI:', j.otpAuthUri);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "4. Confirmar MFA",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/mfa/confirm",
            "description": "Confirma el primer TOTP de Google Authenticator, activa la cuenta y devuelve Access JWT; el refresh token queda en cookie HttpOnly.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"setupToken\": \"{{setupToken}}\",\n  \"code\": \"{{totpCode}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('HTTP 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (j.accessToken) pm.environment.set('accessToken', j.accessToken);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "5. Login usuario/contraseña",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login",
            "description": "Valida usuario/contraseña. Si MFA está configurado devuelve token temporal con nextStep=MFA_VERIFY. Si aún no está configurado puede devolver nextStep=MFA_SETUP.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{email}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('HTTP 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.environment.set('authNextStep', j.nextStep || '');",
                  "if (j.nextStep === 'MFA_SETUP' && j.token) pm.environment.set('setupToken', j.token);",
                  "if (j.nextStep === 'MFA_VERIFY' && j.token) pm.environment.set('challengeToken', j.token);",
                  "console.log('Auth stage:', j);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "6. Verificar MFA y obtener JWT",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/mfa/verify",
            "description": "Valida el TOTP. Devuelve el Access JWT y establece la cookie HttpOnly Secure `fs_refresh`. Postman guarda automáticamente esa cookie para el mismo host.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"challengeToken\": \"{{challengeToken}}\",\n  \"code\": \"{{totpCode}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('HTTP 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (j.accessToken) {",
                  "  pm.environment.set('accessToken', j.accessToken);",
                  "  const parts = j.accessToken.split('.');",
                  "  if (parts.length === 3) {",
                  "    try {",
                  "      let p = parts[1].replace(/-/g, '+').replace(/_/g, '/');",
                  "      while (p.length % 4) p += '=';",
                  "      const decoded = JSON.parse(atob(p));",
                  "      pm.environment.set('jwtPayload', JSON.stringify(decoded));",
                  "      console.log('JWT payload decodificado (NO cifrado):', decoded);",
                  "    } catch (e) { console.log('No se pudo decodificar JWT en script:', e); }",
                  "  }",
                  "}",
                  "if (j.expiresInSeconds !== undefined) pm.environment.set('accessExpiresInSeconds', String(j.expiresInSeconds));",
                  "console.log('Set-Cookie:', pm.response.headers.get('Set-Cookie'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "7. Renovar Access JWT con Refresh Token",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/refresh",
            "description": "No envías el refresh token en JSON. Postman/navegador envía automáticamente la cookie HttpOnly `fs_refresh`. El backend valida su hash en sesiones_usuario, rota el refresh token y devuelve un nuevo Access JWT.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('HTTP 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (j.accessToken) pm.environment.set('accessToken', j.accessToken);",
                  "if (j.expiresInSeconds !== undefined) pm.environment.set('accessExpiresInSeconds', String(j.expiresInSeconds));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "8. Logout",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/logout",
            "description": "Revoca la sesión asociada al refresh token y elimina la cookie `fs_refresh`.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('HTTP 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.environment.unset('accessToken');",
                  "pm.environment.unset('jwtPayload');"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "02 - Social Login OAuth2 / OIDC",
      "description": "Estos flujos son interactivos. Lo ideal es abrir las URLs en navegador. Google usa OAuth2 + OpenID Connect; TikTok Login Kit Web usa OAuth2.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Google - iniciar OAuth2/OIDC",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/oauth2/authorization/google",
            "description": "Redirige a Google. El callback registrado debe coincidir con `{{baseUrl}}/login/oauth2/code/google`. Completa login/consentimiento en navegador.\n\nEste request es GET y no necesita Body.",
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "TikTok - iniciar OAuth2",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/social/tiktok/start",
            "description": "Genera state, guarda cookie HttpOnly de state y redirige a TikTok Login Kit. El callback esperado es `{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/social/tiktok/callback`.\n\nEste request es GET y no necesita Body.",
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Google callback - referencia (no ejecutar manualmente)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/login/oauth2/code/google?code={{oauthAuthorizationCode}}&state={{oauthState}}",
            "description": "Solo referencia. Google invoca este endpoint automáticamente con code/state.\n\nEste request es GET y no necesita Body.",
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "TikTok callback - referencia (no ejecutar manualmente)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/social/tiktok/callback?code={{oauthAuthorizationCode}}&state={{oauthState}}",
            "description": "Solo referencia. TikTok invoca este endpoint automáticamente; state debe coincidir con la cookie generada en /start.\n\nEste request es GET y no necesita Body.",
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "03 - Scoring asíncrono (Outbox + Kafka)",
      "description": "Endpoint principal del flujo Kafka. Requiere Access JWT cuando IAM está integrado.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Registrar solicitud de scoring asíncrona",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/scoring-requests",
            "description": "Registra la solicitud, persiste el workflow/outbox y responde 202. El Outbox Publisher publica posteriormente a Kafka.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"solicitante\": {\n    \"tipoDocumento\": \"DNI\",\n    \"numeroDocumento\": \"{{numeroDocumento}}\",\n    \"nombresRazonSocial\": \"{{nombresRazonSocial}}\",\n    \"correoElectronico\": \"{{email}}\",\n    \"ingresosMensuales\": 5500,\n    \"gastosMensuales\": 1800,\n    \"obligacionesFinancieras\": 700,\n    \"antiguedadLaboralNegocio\": 36,\n    \"numeroObligacionesActivas\": 2,\n    \"puntajeHistorialPagos\": 85,\n    \"alertasMora\": 0\n  },\n  \"solicitud\": {\n    \"codigoProducto\": \"PRESTAMO_PERSONAL\",\n    \"montoSolicitado\": 15000,\n    \"plazoSolicitado\": 24,\n    \"moneda\": \"PEN\",\n    \"finalidadCredito\": \"Consumo\"\n  },\n  \"pago\": {\n    \"banco\": \"BCP\",\n    \"numeroOperacion\": \"PAGO-POSTMAN-{{uniqueSuffix}}\",\n    \"montoPagado\": 30,\n    \"moneda\": \"PEN\",\n    \"fechaPago\": \"{{today}}\"\n  }\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('HTTP 202', () => pm.response.to.have.status(202));",
                  "const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (j.solicitudScoringId) pm.environment.set('solicitudScoringId', j.solicitudScoringId);",
                  "if (j.correlationId) pm.environment.set('correlationId', j.correlationId);",
                  "console.log('Scoring aceptado:', j);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "04 - RF04 / RF05 / RF06 (flujo síncrono existente)",
      "description": "Endpoints ya presentes en el proyecto original. Con IAM integrado quedan protegidos por JWT.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "RF04 - Registrar solicitud de crédito",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/solicitudes-credito",
            "description": "",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"identificadorExterno\": \"POSTMAN-{{uniqueSuffix}}\",\n  \"solicitante\": {\n    \"tipoDocumento\": \"DNI\",\n    \"numeroDocumento\": \"{{numeroDocumento}}\",\n    \"nombresRazonSocial\": \"{{nombresRazonSocial}}\",\n    \"ingresosMensuales\": 5500,\n    \"gastosMensuales\": 1800,\n    \"obligacionesFinancieras\": 700,\n    \"antiguedadLaboralNegocio\": 36,\n    \"numeroObligacionesActivas\": 2,\n    \"puntajeHistorialPagos\": 85,\n    \"alertasMora\": 0\n  },\n  \"codigoProducto\": \"PRESTAMO_PERSONAL\",\n  \"montoSolicitado\": 15000,\n  \"plazoSolicitado\": 24,\n  \"moneda\": \"PEN\",\n  \"finalidadCredito\": \"Consumo\",\n  \"canalOrigen\": \"POSTMAN\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('HTTP 201', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
                  "const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (j.idSolicitud) pm.environment.set('idSolicitud', String(j.idSolicitud));",
                  "console.log('Solicitud creada:', j);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "RF05/RF06 - Evaluar solicitud",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/solicitudes-credito/{{idSolicitud}}/evaluar",
            "description": "Valida reglas de negocio, calcula el score y persiste la evaluación.\n\nNo necesita Body: usa {{idSolicitud}} en la URL."
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('HTTP 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "console.log('Evaluación:', pm.response.json());"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
